WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:08.380
That is gold wire isn’t it? Ok. It is so
small you probably won’t

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.380
see it.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.990
So gold is an element, one of the few elements
that I think

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.480
everybody is very familiar with. Women and
many men wear

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:22.239
it as a wedding ring. I don’t wear a wedding
ring because as a

00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:26.320
chemist I am frightened that it will react
with mercury and go

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:33.070
silver and colour and therefore no longer
look nice.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.911
So here we have a very, very fine sample of
Grade 1

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:40.630
research-quality gold. So everybody knows
that gold is used

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:44.789
to make rings and lots of jewellery and we
do that because it

00:00:44.789 --> 00:00:46.712
is inert. It does not react with anything
at all.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:53.070
Gold used to be, recently, used quite a lot
for filling

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:57.910
people’s teeth or false teeth because it
is chemically very un-

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:02.829
reactive. And gold, like silver, is an element
which is found

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:10.220
naturally, in rocks and so on, actually as
metallic gold. In fact

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.480
unlike a lot of the other elements it is largely
found as

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:17.551
metallic gold. This is why people pan for
gold and so on

00:01:17.551 --> 00:01:20.530
because they fall - the heavy pieces fall
to the ground.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:24.340
So you can very happily wear it for hundreds
of years and it

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.840
will not oxidise or tarnish.

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.740
Gold is very dense, so if this was made of
gold, I could not

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:36.040
just lift it up because it would be just too
heavy and the

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:42.130
mines that make platinum and the other noble
metals also

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:45.610
get quite a large amount of gold at the same
time because

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.380
gold occurs naturally with a greater abundance
than these

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.820
other metals.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:55.950
Gold obviously is also a storage of wealth
because of the fact

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:59.530
that it is so inert, in terms of value, I
think this gold is

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:05.500
perhaps maybe about 10 pence. It is probably
more

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.140
expensive than that actually because this
is Grade 1.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:12.250
Recently chemists have realised that gold
although it is

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:17.870
chemically rather un-reactive, can form quite
good catalysts

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:21.200
and so that there is a lot of research going
on at the moment

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:26.230
to try and see what gold can and cannot do.
Because as it is

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:30.750
much more abundant than other heavy metals
there is quite

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.160
enough gold to make all the catalysts we could
possibly want.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:40.780
There is 1.17 grams when it is full. I think
there is probably

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:44.140
about 50mg. Ok, let’s pop that back in.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.500
The alchemist idea of making gold from lead
and so on is

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:52.460
completely mad, it is not physically possible.
However in

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:59.490
modern times when people made/got nuclear
reactors and

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.940
even more when they got so called accelerators
where they

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:09.970
can use electric fields to make the nucleus
of atoms travel at

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:13.950
enormous speed then they can actually make
two atoms bang

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:18.580
together and turn into another one, but this
is on a very small

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:22.570
scale, atom by atom, and is it not a way that
you could

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:26.550
industrially manufacture. If you want to become
rich there are

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.220
better ways than trying to make gold.

